  "content": {
    "id": "p63-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Find the missing values by equating coefficients.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p63-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$4x^{3}+(x+a)(x+b)+cx=ax^{3}-3x^{3}+x^{2}-x-42$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=7,\\ b=-6,\\ c=-2$",
          "worked": "Expand and collect like terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}4x^{3}+(x+a)(x+b)+cx&=4x^{3}+x^{2}+(a+b+c)x+ab.\\end{align*}$$\nEquate coefficients and constant terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}4&=a-3\\\\a&=7\\\\ab&=-42\\\\7b&=-42\\\\b&=-6\\\\a+b+c&=-1\\\\7-6+c&=-1\\\\c&=-2.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 49
      },
      {
        "id": "p63-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(ax+1)(x+5)(x+b)=2x^{3}+23x^{2}+71x+30$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=2,\\ b=6$",
          "worked": "Expand and collect like terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}(ax+1)(x+5)(x+b)&=(ax+1)\\bigl(x^{2}+(b+5)x+5b\\bigr)\\\\&=ax^{3}+\\bigl(a(b+5)+1\\bigr)x^{2}+(5ab+b+5)x+5b.\\end{align*}$$\nEquate the coefficients of $x^{3}$ and the constant terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}a&=2\\\\5b&=30\\\\b&=6.\\end{align*}$$\nCheck the remaining coefficients:\n$$\\begin{align*}a(b+5)+1&=2(6+5)+1=23\\\\5ab+b+5&=5(2)(6)+6+5=71.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p63-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(x+a)^{2}(x-2)=x^{3}+bx^{2}-3x-18$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=3,\\ b=4$",
          "worked": "Expand and collect like terms:\n$$\\begin{align*}(x+a)^{2}(x-2)&=(x^{2}+2ax+a^{2})(x-2)\\\\&=x^{3}+(2a-2)x^{2}+(a^{2}-4a)x-2a^{2}.\\end{align*}$$\nEquate constant terms and coefficients:\n$$\\begin{align*}-2a^{2}&=-18\\\\a^{2}&=9\\\\a^{2}-4a&=-3\\\\9-4a&=-3\\\\a&=3\\\\b&=2a-2\\\\b&=2(3)-2\\\\b&=4.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 49
      },
      {
        "id": "p63-q9-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": {
          "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
          "version": 1,
          "blocks": [
